── detail · new view ──
Make another view for the Jira nav pane.

Give it a name; it starts with your open tickets. Then add conditions from its menu: who it is assigned to, status, sprint, project, type, label, when it changed, or words. JQL by hand is there too.
── status · SETTINGS ──
q quit  x extra actions  ~ notices  ←→↑↓ navigate
